# Needs the dev test stock (TST). UI only: no days advanced, no trades.
name clicking a Stock Monitor row opens its detail: price, change vs yesterday, 7D/30D chart, stats, Buy opens the game's dialog, back returns to the list
monitor remember
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRow-TST
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetail
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailSymbol TST
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailName Test Stock
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailPrice ₡
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailYesterday Today
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailFrom 30 days ago
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailStat-0-1 ₡
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture stock-monitor-detail
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRange-7
wait 1
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailFrom 7 days ago
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture stock-monitor-detail-7d
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetailBuy
wait 1
expect-text Button Buy
close-dialog
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorBack
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorRows
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorDetail
cleanup:
close-dialog
monitor close
monitor restore
